### Create
POST {{DaffaCatering.API_HostAddress}}/api/Pemasok
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idPemasok": "PMS0000013",
  "namaPemasok": "Test Pemasok",
  "alamat": "Jl. Merdeka No. 10",
  "noKontak": "081234567890",
  "status": true,
  "tglBergabung": "2026-01-01"
}

### Update
PUT {{DaffaCatering.API_HostAddress}}/api/Pemasok/PMS0000013
